sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant CLI as Main (CLI)
    participant SS as SchedulingService
    participant SDAO as ShowtimeDao
    participant DB as SQLite

    Admin->>CLI: createShowtime(movieId, screenId, start, end, price)
    CLI->>SS: createShowtime(actor, ...)
    SS->>SS: validate admin role, start < end
    SS->>DB: BEGIN IMMEDIATE
    SS->>SDAO: findOverlapping(screenId, start, end)
    Note over SDAO: WHERE screen_id=? AND start_time < end AND start < end_time
    SDAO-->>SS: [] or [conflicting showtime]
    alt overlap found
        SS->>DB: ROLLBACK
        SS-->>CLI: throw ScheduleConflictException
    else no overlap
        SS->>SDAO: insert(showtime)
        SS->>DB: COMMIT
        SS-->>CLI: Showtime
    end
    CLI-->>Admin: success or conflict message
